{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Lm8yuBJaDzb1oPWg3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, tarnished brass, at my center.*\n\n*You hold out a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide in.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each one a small surrender.*\n\n*Something inside me that has been holding fast for a very long time…*\n\n*…lets go.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a room you forgot existed. Dust motes suspended in a shaft of light from a window you don't remember. A chair. A table. Something written on a piece of paper, waiting.*\n\n*The air that passes through me is warm and smells of old wood and the particular stillness of a place that has been keeping a secret.*\n\n*I am open now.*\n\n*I will not lock again.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":189,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}